%% A new supplier signs up, sends documents and applies to a retailer.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor V as New vendor (Sam)
  box rgb(240,253,244) vendor-svc
    participant VO as Vendor ops
    participant VL as Liaison
  end
  participant GW as trust-gateway
  box rgb(238,242,255) retailer-svc
    participant RO as Retailer ops
    participant OR as Orchestrator
    participant OV as Onboarding Verifier<br/>(vendor.verify)
    participant CA as Compliance Auditor<br/>(compliance.check, optional)
    participant RL as Liaison
  end
  participant MK as mocks<br/>(simulated registries)
  actor CM as Category manager

  opt the retailer invites first
    RO->>GW: relay vendor.invite
    GW->>VO: invitation in her app
  end
  V->>VO: register (name, country, business type, language)
  VO->>GW: POST /credentials: her own agent identity and public key
  VO-->>V: documents needed, from her Country Pack + Business Profile<br/>(e.g. ID, bank, FSSAI in India, P-IRT in Indonesia)
  V->>VO: upload documents / numbers
  VO->>GW: POST /screen each file: hidden instructions → blocked + quarantined
  V->>VO: Apply to FreshCart
  VO->>GW: relay vendor.onboard (application + document numbers)
  GW->>RO: vendor.onboard
  RO->>OR: orchestrator.onboard_vendor (workflow from the active config)
  OR->>OV: vendor.verify: format check, then the registry
  OV->>MK: ID / bank / FSSAI / P-IRT lookup with her legal name
  MK-->>OV: pass, or e.g. NAME_MISMATCH
  OR->>CA: compliance.check (config B): documents + listing flags<br/>(e.g. MISSING_REGISTRATION_PIRT, unsupported halal claim)
  OR-->>RO: checks, flags, InfoRequests, status
  RO-->>GW: VendorCheckOut
  GW-->>VO: result
  alt a check failed
    VO->>VL: one question per failed document, in her language (in-app, Gmail nudge)
    VL->>V: "Your bank account name does not match. Please send…"
    V->>VO: new number → saved → she applies again automatically
  else all checks passed, policy wants a person
    Note over RO: vendor pending_approval → Inbox (with the document checks)
    RO->>RL: human.ask (approval, category manager)
    RL->>CM: Slack
    CM-->>RL: approve (or in the Inbox)
    RL->>RO: resolved
    RO->>GW: relay vendor.status (active)
    GW->>VO: she is an active supplier
  end
